      "side": 1,
      "message": "Instead of an explicit passthrough on all of these, maybe put a default implementation in toolchainBase that returns \"\", make it unexported (ndkTriple) so nothing outside config calls it, and add a function in toolchain.go:\n\nfunc NDKTriple(toolchain Toolchain) string {\n    triple :\u003d toolchain.ndkTriple()\n    if triple \u003d\u003d \"\" {\n        // Use the clang triple if there is no explicit NDK triple\n        triple \u003d toolchain.ClangTriple()\n    }\n    return triple\n}",
